>
  <p>Not every tired surface needs to come out. When the concrete underneath is sound, a proper repair restores the space for a fraction of the cost of a new pour. <a href="/">Concrete Toronto</a> repairs and resurfaces concrete cracks and uneven surfaces across Toronto and the GTA.</p>

  <p>The key word is proper. A patch slapped over a dirty, loose surface fails within a season. We cut out the failed material, clean the substrate, and bond the repair so it becomes part of the slab instead of sitting on top of it.</p>

  <h2>What's included in our concrete repair service</h2>
  <p>Every repair is quoted in writing after we see the damage:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>An honest assessment</strong> of repair versus replacement</li>
    <li><strong>Crack repair</strong> for driveways, walkways, sidewalks and slabs</li>
    <li><strong>Resurfacing</strong> for scaled, spalled or pitted areas</li>
    <li><strong>Edge and nosing rebuilds</strong> on steps and curbs</li>
    <li><strong>Levelling of uneven sections</strong> where the base allows it</li>
    <li><strong>Full cleanup</strong> when the work is done</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>When repair is the wrong answer</h2>
  <p>We will not sell you a repair that cannot last. If the base has failed, if cracking runs through the slab, or if the surface is gone across most of the area, <a href="/services/concrete-replacement/">replacement</a> is the honest recommendation and we will show you why. A repair on concrete that needs replacing just postpones the inevitable and costs you twice.</p>

  <h2>Why homeowners choose us</h2>
  <p>15 years of concrete work across Toronto means we have diagnosed every failure pattern this climate produces. You get a straight answer, a written price, and a 2-year warranty on the repair.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>2-year warranty on our work</li>
    <li>Satisfaction guaranteed</li>
    <li>Free, no-obligation quotes</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Send a photo or two with the form and we can often tell you right away whether repair or replacement makes sense. We work across the GTA, see our <a href="/locations/">service areas</a>.</p>
